---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Header from '~/components/widgets/Header.astro';
import Content from '~/components/widgets/Content.astro';
import Features2 from '~/components/widgets/Features2.astro';
import { headerData } from '~/navigation';

const metadata = {
  title: 'OpenMV Business Proposal',
};

const bi = (k: string, e: string) => `<span data-lang-ko>${k}</span><span data-lang-en>${e}</span>`;
// Use when the bilingual content contains block-level HTML (<ul>, <p>, etc.); span auto-closes before block children.
const biBlock = (k: string, e: string) => `<div data-lang-ko>${k}</div><div data-lang-en>${e}</div>`;
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <Fragment slot="header">
    <Header {...headerData} isSticky showToggleTheme showToggleLanguage />
  </Fragment>

  <section class="relative md:-mt-[76px] not-prose">
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="pt-0 md:pt-[76px] pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="py-12 md:py-20">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
          <div class="text-left md:sticky md:top-28">
            <span class="text-accent font-bold tracking-wide uppercase">Business Proposal</span>
            <h1
              class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tighter mb-6 mt-4 font-heading dark:text-gray-200"
            >
              OpenMV<br />
              <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-3xl md:text-4xl block mt-2 leading-snug">
                <span data-lang-ko>차세대 제조 혁신을 위한<br />개방형 비전-MES<br />상호운용 표준</span>
                <span data-lang-en
                  >An Open Interoperability Standard<br />for Vision &amp; MES<br />in Next-Gen Manufacturing</span
                >
              </span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-muted dark:text-slate-300 max-w-lg">
              <span data-lang-ko
                >대한민국 제조 산업의 막힌 혈관을 뚫어주는<br />
                <strong>디지털 인프라 표준화 사업</strong></span
              >
              <span data-lang-en
                >Unclogging the arteries of Korean manufacturing through a<br />
                <strong>digital infrastructure standardization initiative.</strong></span
              >
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="relative bg-blue-50 dark:bg-slate-800 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-lg"
          >
            <div class="mb-8 border-b border-blue-200 dark:border-slate-600 pb-6 last:border-0 last:pb-0 last:mb-0">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-white flex items-center">
                <div
                  class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 shrink-0"
                >
                  <svg
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-300"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    ><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path><path
                      d="M3 7m0 2a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-14a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2z"></path><path
                      d="M8 7v-2a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path><path d="M12 12l0 .01"></path><path
                      d="M3 13a20 20 0 0 0 18 0"></path></svg
                  >
                </div>
                <span data-lang-ko>1.1. 사업 명 (가칭)</span>
                <span data-lang-en>1.1. Project Name (working title)</span>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed pl-11">
                <strong>OpenMV (Open Manufacturing Vision Interface):</strong><br />
                <span data-lang-ko
                  >이기종 제조 시스템 간 초연결을 위한 비전 데이터 표준 프로토콜 및 고속 I/O 라이브러리 개발 사업</span
                >
                <span data-lang-en
                  >Developing a standard vision-data protocol and a high-speed I/O library for hyper-connectivity across
                  heterogeneous manufacturing systems.</span
                >
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-8 border-b border-blue-200 dark:border-slate-600 pb-6 last:border-0 last:pb-0 last:mb-0">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-white flex items-center">
                <div
                  class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 shrink-0"
                >
                  <svg
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    ><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path><path
                      d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 18 0a9 9 0 0 0 -18 0"></path><path d="M12 8v4"></path><path d="M12 16h.01"
                    ></path></svg
                  >
                </div>
                <span data-lang-ko>1.2. 추진 배경</span>
                <span data-lang-en>1.2. Background</span>
              </h3>
              <ul
                class="list-disc list-outside ml-4 pl-7 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base marker:text-blue-500"
              >
                <li>
                  <span data-lang-ko
                    ><strong>제조 현장의 '데이터 바벨탑' 현상:</strong> 핵심 품질 검사 도구인 '비전 SW'와 생산 관리의 두뇌인
                    'MES' 간 상호운용성 부재.</span
                  >
                  <span data-lang-en
                    ><strong>The "Tower of Babel" of factory data:</strong> there is no interoperability between Vision SW
                    — the core quality inspection tool — and MES, the brain of production management.</span
                  >
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span data-lang-ko
                    ><strong>국가적 비효율 심화:</strong> 장비 도입 시 커스터마이징(SI) 비용 과다 및 리소스 낭비 초래.</span
                  >
                  <span data-lang-en
                    ><strong>Compounding national inefficiency:</strong> every new piece of equipment racks up excessive
                    SI customization costs and wastes resources.</span
                  >
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-white flex items-center">
                <div
                  class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 shrink-0"
                >
                  <svg
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600 dark:text-green-300"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    ><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path><path
                      d="M12 12m-1 0a1 1 0 1 0 2 0a1 1 0 1 0 -2 0"></path><path
                      d="M12 12m-5 0a5 5 0 1 0 10 0a5 5 0 1 0 -10 0"></path><path
                      d="M12 12m-9 0a9 9 0 1 0 18 0a9 9 0 1 0 -18 0"></path></svg
                  >
                </div>
                <span data-lang-ko>1.3. 사업 목표</span>
                <span data-lang-en>1.3. Project Goals</span>
              </h3>
              <ul
                class="list-disc list-outside ml-4 pl-7 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base marker:text-green-500"
              >
                <li>
                  <span data-lang-ko
                    ><strong>"선언하면 연결된다":</strong> 복잡한 코딩 없이 라이브러리 호출만으로 즉시 연동되는 표준 프로토콜
                    및 SDK 개발.</span
                  >
                  <span data-lang-en
                    ><strong>"Declare it, and it connects":</strong> build a standard protocol and SDK that integrates instantly
                    through a library call — no complex coding required.</span
                  >
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span data-lang-ko
                    ><strong>K-Standard의 글로벌화:</strong> 국내 실증 표준 확립을 통한 글로벌 제조 데이터 인터페이스 주도권
                    확보.</span
                  >
                  <span data-lang-en
                    ><strong>Taking the K-Standard global:</strong> establish a domestically proven standard and lead the
                    global manufacturing data interface.</span
                  >
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl mb-2">
          <span data-lang-ko>2. 현황 및 문제점 (WHY)</span>
          <span data-lang-en>2. Status &amp; Pain Points (WHY)</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-muted">
          <span data-lang-ko>파편화된 제조 소프트웨어 생태계의 한계</span>
          <span data-lang-en>The limits of a fragmented manufacturing software ecosystem</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <div class="p-3 bg-red-100 text-red-600 rounded-full mb-4">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              class="w-8 h-8"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke="currentColor"
              fill="none"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path><path d="M12 9v2m0 4v.01"></path><path
                d="M5 19h14a2 2 0 0 0 1.84 -2.75l-7.1 -12.25a2 2 0 0 0 -3.5 0l-7.1 12.25a2 2 0 0 0 1.75 2.75"
              ></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">
            <span data-lang-ko>비표준화된 연동 방식</span>
            <span data-lang-en>Non-standardized integration</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm">
            <span data-lang-ko
              >비전 SW 개발사별 CSV, TXT, Socket, PLC Memory Map 등 표준화되지 않은 방식의 개별적 사용 만연.</span
            >
            <span data-lang-en
              >Each Vision SW vendor uses its own ad-hoc method — CSV, TXT, Socket, PLC Memory Map — with no shared
              standard.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <div class="p-3 bg-orange-100 text-orange-600 rounded-full mb-4">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              class="w-8 h-8"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke="currentColor"
              fill="none"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path><path d="M3 3v18h18"></path><path
                d="M18.7 6.8l-3.2 5.3"></path><path d="M9 11l-3 3"></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">
            <span data-lang-ko>데이터 통합 불가</span>
            <span data-lang-en>No data integration</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm">
            <span data-lang-ko>기 도입된 타사 MES 시스템과의 통합 운용 한계 및 라인 증설 시 연동 비용 중복 발생.</span>
            <span data-lang-en
              >Existing third-party MES systems are hard to integrate, and every line expansion duplicates integration
              costs.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <div class="p-3 bg-gray-200 text-gray-600 rounded-full mb-4">
            <svg
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              class="w-8 h-8"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke="currentColor"
              fill="none"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path><path d="M4 7l16 0"></path><path d="M10 11l0 6"
              ></path><path d="M14 11l0 6"></path><path d="M5 7l1 12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h8a2 2 0 0 0 2 -2l1 -12"></path><path
                d="M9 7v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1 -1h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3"></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">
            <span data-lang-ko>데이터의 사장 (Data Silo)</span>
            <span data-lang-en>Buried data (Data Silo)</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm">
            <span data-lang-ko>단순 OK/NG 판정 외 AI 재학습에 필수적인 고부가가치 데이터의 미전송 및 사장(死藏).</span>
            <span data-lang-en
              >Beyond simple OK/NG verdicts, the high-value data essential for AI retraining never makes it out — and
              ends up buried.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-center">
          <span data-lang-ko>기존 표준화 시도의 한계와 차별점</span>
          <span data-lang-en>How OpenMV differs from prior standardization attempts</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-8 text-center text-muted">
          <span data-lang-ko
            >기존 글로벌 표준(OPC UA 등)은 '제어(Control)' 중심의 무거운 표준으로, 대용량 이미지와 AI 메타데이터를
            포함하는 현대적 비전 시스템 적용에 한계 상존.</span
          >
          <span data-lang-en
            >Existing global standards (e.g., OPC UA) are heavyweight, control-centric specs — a poor fit for modern
            vision systems that handle large images and AI metadata.</span
          >
        </p>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg shadow border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
          <table class="w-full text-sm text-left border-collapse">
            <thead class="bg-gray-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
              <tr>
                <th class="p-4 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 w-1/6">
                  <span data-lang-ko>구분</span>
                  <span data-lang-en>Category</span>
                </th>
                <th class="p-4 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 w-5/12 text-gray-500"
                  >OPC UA / IPC-CFX (<span data-lang-ko>기존</span><span data-lang-en>existing</span>)</th
                >
                <th
                  class="p-4 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 w-5/12 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/10"
                  >OpenMV (<span data-lang-ko>제안 기술</span><span data-lang-en>proposed</span>)</th
                >
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td
                  class="p-4 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 font-semibold bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50"
                >
                  <span data-lang-ko>목적</span>
                  <span data-lang-en>Purpose</span>
                </td>
                <td class="p-4 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700">
                  <span data-lang-ko>설비 제어 및 상태 모니터링</span>
                  <span data-lang-en>Equipment control and status monitoring</span>
                </td>
                <td
                  class="p-4 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 bg-blue-50/50 dark:bg-blue-900/10 font-semibold"
                >
                  <span data-lang-ko>비전 검사 데이터(Rule-based + AI)의 포괄적 처리</span>
                  <span data-lang-en>End-to-end handling of vision inspection data (rule-based + AI)</span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td
                  class="p-4 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 font-semibold bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50"
                >
                  <span data-lang-ko>방식</span>
                  <span data-lang-en>Approach</span>
                </td>
                <td class="p-4 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700">
                  <span data-lang-ko>복잡한 노드 구조 및 인증 절차</span>
                  <span data-lang-en>Complex node structures and certification flows</span>
                </td>
                <td
                  class="p-4 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 bg-blue-50/50 dark:bg-blue-900/10 font-semibold"
                >
                  <span data-lang-ko>실용적인 스키마(Schema) & 라이브러리(SDK)</span>
                  <span data-lang-en>Pragmatic schema and SDK</span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td
                  class="p-4 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 font-semibold bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50"
                >
                  <span data-lang-ko>난이도</span>
                  <span data-lang-en>Adoption</span>
                </td>
                <td class="p-4 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700">
                  <span data-lang-ko>도입에 수개월 소요 (높은 진입장벽)</span>
                  <span data-lang-en>Takes months to roll out (high entry barrier)</span>
                </td>
                <td
                  class="p-4 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 bg-blue-50/50 dark:bg-blue-900/10 font-semibold"
                >
                  <span data-lang-ko>코드 몇 줄로 즉시 적용 (Plug & Play)</span>
                  <span data-lang-en>A few lines of code, instantly applied (Plug &amp; Play)</span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 font-semibold bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800/50">
                  <span data-lang-ko>접근법</span>
                  <span data-lang-en>Philosophy</span>
                </td>
                <td class="p-4">
                  <span data-lang-ko>Top-Down (스펙 정의 후 구현 강요)</span>
                  <span data-lang-en>Top-down: define a spec, then force implementation</span>
                </td>
                <td class="p-4 bg-blue-50/50 dark:bg-blue-900/10 font-semibold">
                  <span data-lang-ko>Bottom-Up (SDK 배포를 통한 실용적 확산)</span>
                  <span data-lang-en>Bottom-up: ship an SDK and let pragmatic adoption spread</span>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-900 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl mb-4">
          <span data-lang-ko>3. 사업 내용 및 기술적 접근 (WHAT)</span>
          <span data-lang-en>3. Scope &amp; Technical Approach (WHAT)</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-muted">
          <span data-lang-ko>복잡성의 추상화 (Black-box SDK Strategy)</span>
          <span data-lang-en>Abstracting away complexity (a black-box SDK strategy)</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">
            <span data-lang-ko>핵심 전략</span>
            <span data-lang-en>Core strategy</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="mb-6 text-muted">
            <span data-lang-ko
              >통신 프로토콜의 복잡한 내부 구조(패킷 순서, 바이너리 변환, 에러 핸들링 등)를 개발자가 인지할 필요 없는
              <strong>완벽하게 추상화된 SDK(Black-box) 형태 제공.</strong><br /><br />
              - <strong>개념:</strong> 개발자는 "데이터 전송" 행위에만 집중하며, 구체적인 전송 로직은 표준 라이브러리가 전담
              처리.<br />
              - <strong>지향점:</strong> USB 장치 연결 시 드라이버가 자동 통신하듯, SW 레벨에서의
              <strong>Plug & Play 구현.</strong></span
            >
            <span data-lang-en
              >Hide the gritty internals of the wire protocol — packet ordering, binary encoding, error handling —
              behind a <strong>fully abstracted, black-box SDK.</strong><br /><br />
              - <strong>Concept:</strong> developers focus solely on "sending data"; the standard library handles the transport
              logic.<br />
              - <strong>Goal:</strong> the way a USB driver auto-negotiates when you plug in a device, but at the software
              layer — <strong>true Plug &amp; Play.</strong></span
            >
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">
            <span data-lang-ko>개발 범위</span>
            <span data-lang-en>Scope of development</span>
          </h3>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded shadow-sm">
              <strong class="block mb-2 text-primary"
                >A. <span data-lang-ko>표준 데이터 스키마</span><span data-lang-en>Standard Data Schema</span> (OpenMV Schema)</strong
              >
